# Embed UI shell

`embed-boot.ts` fills a host div with `shell.html` inside a shadow root and loads `ghoul-viewer.css` there. `embed.html` is only the demo page (black background, a 400×206 div, one script line).

## Do

- Put UI shell styles in `ghoul-viewer.css`, not inline in `embed.html`
- Keep tokens on `.ghoul-stage-scale` (`--gv-*`), never on the host `:root`
- Reset inherited font, color, and line-height on `:host` and `.ghoul-stage-scale`
- Leave page layout (full-viewport black, centering) in `embed.html` only
- Default to native 1×. Scaling is only `data-scale="fit"`

## Don't

- Style bare `html` / `body` / global `*` inside `ghoul-viewer.css`
- Link `ghoul-viewer.css` from the host page
- Copy the shell markup into the host page
- Scale the stage from the window width

## Host line

```html
<script type="module" src="ghoul-viewer/embed.js" data-target="#ghoul" data-ghoul="469"></script>
```
